### QT 관리자 운영 API
### ADMIN 역할 계정으로 발급한 adminAccessToken이 필요합니다.

### 최근 30일 QT 통계
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/quiet-time/statistics
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 일회성 진행 중 QT 검색
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/quiet-time/sessions?scope=STANDALONE&status=OPEN&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

> {%
  if (response.body.content.length > 0) {
    client.global.set("adminQuietTimeSessionId", response.body.content[0].id);
  }
%}

### QT 상세 및 최근 감사 로그
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/quiet-time/sessions/{{adminQuietTimeSessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### QR 즉시 폐기
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/quiet-time/sessions/{{adminQuietTimeSessionId}}/revoke-qr
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operationId": "{{$uuid}}",
  "reason": "노출된 QR 초대 링크 즉시 폐기"
}

### QT 강제 종료
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/quiet-time/sessions/{{adminQuietTimeSessionId}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operationId": "{{$uuid}}",
  "reason": "운영 정책 위반 세션 강제 종료"
}
